// What every formation is made of: a couple, side by side, the robin on the
// lark's right. `spacing` is how far apart the two stand — 0.8 m shoulder to
// shoulder on a becket line, 1.28 m across the set in an improper one. The
// couple's own frame sits between them, facing the way they face.

formation couple(spacing: Length = 0.8m) {
  place lark role Lark at translate(y = -spacing / 2);
  place robin role Robin at translate(y = spacing / 2);
  anchor centre = midpoint(lark, robin);
  provide $partner: Place = other(me);
  provide $role: Role = role(me);
}
